{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785216914336,"sessionID":"ses_058ca7309ffeyGmRDCjINe2gtX","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_00_4gFoTOuzh20k3UifBqeI3429","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Deep Review Strategy — DeepSeek Lane\n\n## topic\n\nCode Graph Decommission Deep Review: auditing every decommission-touched surface (system-spec-kit/mcp-server, system-skill-advisor, deep-loop runtime, .opencode/commands/doctor, four agent mirrors, hooks, lifecycle scripts) for regressions, missed residue, and dishonest completion claims. External lane (DeepSeek v4 Pro), autonomous execution, max-iterations=5 stop policy.\n\n## review-dimensions\n\n- [ ] Correctness — logic, invariants, edge cases, residual code-graph references\n- [ ] Security — trust boundaries, auth/authz, secrets exposure, input handling\n- [ ] Traceability — spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\n- [ ] Maintainability — codebase patterns, documentation quality, clarity\n\n## completed-dimensions\n\nNone yet.\n\n## running-findings\n\nP0: 0 | P1: 0 | P2: 0\n\n## what-worked\n \nNone yet.\n\n## what-failed\n\nNone yet.\n\n## exhausted-approaches\n\nNone yet.\n\n## ruled-out-directions\n\nNone yet.\n\n## next-focus\n\nCorrectness dimension: verify no stale/incorrect code-graph references remain, check for broken imports, verify that decommissioned code paths are fully removed and replacement paths are wired correctly.\n\n## known-context\n\n- The code-graph decommission removed structural (AST-based) code search across 5 runtimes.\n- An operator spot-check already caught six doctor assets the executing sweep missed (evidence of residue).\n- The doctor command's `_routes.yaml` had code-graph routes removed (causal-graph, deep-loop remain).\n- Agent mirrors were synced across runtimes after decommission (`8217ec40a1` fixed orchestrate mirror drift and quoted colon-bearing descriptions).\n- Deep-loop runtime gained 7 per-mode resume-adapter columns and certificate packages.\n- The `6ba0ee354c` commit explicitly purged remaining code-graph references from doctor command assets.\n- resource-map.md not present. Skipping coverage gate.\n\n## cross-reference-status\n\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-------|\n| spec_code | core | pending | Compare spec claims vs implementation |\n| checklist_evidence | core | pending | Verify checklist completion claims |\n\n## files-under-review\n\n| File/Path | Status | Notes |\n|-----------|--------|-------|\n| .opencode/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml | pending | Was modified in decommission |\n| .opencode/commands/doctor/assets/*.yaml | pending | Doctor command assets |\n| .opencode/commands/doctor/scripts/*.cjs | pending | Doctor scripts |\n| .opencode/agents/*.md | pending | Agent mirrors |\n| .claude/agents/*.md | pending | Agent mirrors |\n| .codex/agents/*.toml | pending | Agent mirrors |\n| .opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/ | pending | Deep-loop runtime |\n| .opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/mcp-server/ | pending | Memory MCP server |\n| .opencode/skills/system-skill-advisor/ | pending | Skill advisor |\n\n## review-boundaries\n\n- maxIterations: 5\n- convergenceThreshold: 0.05\n- stopPolicy: max-iterations (convergence is telemetry-only)\n- sessionId: fanout-deepseek-1785216731182-5rt43x\n- executionMode: autonomous\n- lineageMode: new\n","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/system-code-graph/036-code-graph-decommission/016-deep-review/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/system-code-graph/036-code-graph-decommission/016-deep-review/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":".opencode/specs/system-code-graph/036-code-graph-decommission/016-deep-review/review/lineages/deepseek/deep-review-strategy.md","time":{"start":1785216914329,"end":1785216914334}},"id":"prt_fa7382313001jrcxjs9tfj2UpU","sessionID":"ses_058ca7309ffeyGmRDCjINe2gtX","messageID":"msg_fa738113e001Ae3PQOgaZ08thv"}}
