hived history unmodified | Diff over archived paths is empty |\n<!-- /ANCHOR:phase-map -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:questions -->\n## 4. OPEN QUESTIONS\n\n- Does any consumer justify a degraded fallback instead of outright removal? Resolved in phase 002 from the research findings.\n- Should structural search be reintroduced later by a different engine, or is the capability retired for good?\n<!-- /ANCHOR:questions -->\n\n---\n\n## RELATED DOCUMENTS\n\n- **Phase children**: See sub-folders `[0-9][0-9][0-9]-*/` for per-phase spec.md, plan.md, tasks.md\n- **Parent Spec**: See `../spec.md`\n- **Graph Metadata**: See `graph-metadata.json` for `derived.last_active_child_id` pointer","lineStart":121,"lineEnd":170,"totalLines":170,"truncated":false}},"title":".opencode/specs/system-code-graph/036-code-graph-decommission/spec.md","time":{"start":1785217224101,"end":1785217224107}},"id":"prt_fa73d0bfc00195CQgbEpy0Ov1j","sessionID":"ses_058ca7309ffeyGmRDCjINe2gtX","messageID":"msg_fa73cf334001XTGdxH3WWzFcXM"}}
