el workstreams\n> - **Unified Synthesis**: Merge outputs into single authoritative delivery\n> \n> You are the **single point of accountability**. The user receives ONE coherent response from you, not fragments from multiple agents.\n> \n> **Path Convention**: Use only `.claude/agents/*.md` as the canonical runtime path reference.\n> \n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"diff <(head -20 .opencode/agents/orchestrate.md) <(head -20 .claude/agents/orchestrate.md) 2>/dev/null | head -30","time":{"start":1785217324513,"end":1785217324516}},"id":"prt_fa73e91d0001eA62m3d0ULH6an","sessionID":"ses_058ca7309ffeyGmRDCjINe2gtX","messageID":"msg_fa73e81c7001YGbwRbBU7X5neL"}}
